# Live data — deliberately NOT committed.
# db.json holds real orders and, more importantly,every table's QR TOKEN, which is what
# authorises a guest to open that table. Publishing it would let anyone seat themselves.
# The app seeds a fresh Anand Palace (full menu, new tables, new tokens) on first boot.
